<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<bpmn:definitions xmlns:bioc="http://bpmn.io/schema/bpmn/biocolor/1.0" xmlns:bpmn="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/MODEL" xmlns:bpmndi="http://www.omg.org/spec/BPMN/20100524/DI" xmlns:dc="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DC" xmlns:di="http://www.omg.org/spec/DD/20100524/DI" id="Definitions_fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail" targetNamespace="https://fluxbank.local/architecture" exporter="FluxBank architecture documentation" exporterVersion="2">
  <bpmn:process id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_app" name="FluxBank | internal transfer" isExecutable="false">
    <bpmn:laneSet id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_app_lanes">
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_app_pre" name="Entry">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_startEvent1</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_subProcess2</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_app_fin" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_subProcess9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
      <bpmn:lane id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_app_result" name="Result / failure">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask24</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask27</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_exclusiveGateway29</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask31</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask32</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
      </bpmn:lane>
    </bpmn:laneSet>
    <bpmn:startEvent id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_startEvent1" name="Entry checks passed">
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow8</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:subProcess id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_subProcess2" name="TX-PENDING | TransferLifecycleService.createPending()">
      <bpmn:documentation>Spring proxy starts this database transaction on entry. Successful return/flush commits all enclosed writes. RuntimeException or commit failure rolls back the enclosed writes. JPA SQL may be issued at flush; the diagram shows Java execution order. REQUIRED joins a caller transaction; the normal HTTP orchestration has no outer transaction.
Sources: TransferLifecycleService.createPending() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/TransferLifecycleService.java:32</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask3" name="01 | Generate transfer reference&#10;TransferReferenceGenerator&#10;.nextReference()">
        <bpmn:documentation>SELECT nextval('fluxbank.transfer_reference_seq'); TRX-yyyyMMdd-sequence. Sequence increments do not roll back.
Sources: TransferReferenceGenerator.nextReference() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/TransferReferenceGenerator.java:18</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow6</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask4" name="02 | INSERT fluxbank.transfers&#10;Transfer.create() → save()&#10;INTERNAL / PENDING / 100 EUR">
        <bpmn:documentation>TransferRepository.save(). UUID + unique reference, source=A, destination=B, beneficiary snapshot. Completed/failure fields null.
Sources: Transfer.create() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/domain/Transfer.java:157; TransferLifecycleService.createPending() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/TransferLifecycleService.java:32</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow6</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow7</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_endEvent5" name="COMMIT">
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow7</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow6" sourceRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask3" targetRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow7" sourceRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask4" targetRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_endEvent5" />
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow8" sourceRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_startEvent1" targetRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_subProcess2" />
    <bpmn:subProcess id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_subProcess9" name="TX-FINANCIAL | InternalTransferProcessor.process()">
      <bpmn:documentation>Spring proxy starts this database transaction on entry. Successful return/flush commits all enclosed writes. RuntimeException or commit failure rolls back the enclosed writes. JPA SQL may be issued at flush; the diagram shows Java execution order. REQUIRED joins a caller transaction; the normal HTTP orchestration has no outer transaction.
Sources: InternalTransferProcessor.process() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/InternalTransferProcessor.java:37</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask10" name="03 | Lock pending Transfer&#10;TransferRepository&#10;.findByPublicIdForUpdate()">
        <bpmn:documentation>PESSIMISTIC_WRITE; require PENDING and INTERNAL.
Sources: TransferRepository.findByPublicIdForUpdate() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/repository/TransferRepository.java:26</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask11" name="04 | Lock both balances&#10;AccountBalanceRepository&#10;Order by account.id ASC">
        <bpmn:documentation>findAllByAccountPublicIdInForUpdate(List.of(A,B)); require exactly two rows, resolve by account public UUID. Deterministic lock order reduces deadlock risk.
Sources: AccountBalanceRepository.findAllByAccountPublicIdInForUpdate() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/account/repository/AccountBalanceRepository.java:29</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask12" name="05 | Validate currency + state&#10;Account.validateAvailableForDebit()&#10;Account.validateAvailableForCredit()">
        <bpmn:documentation>Same currency required; no FX. Outgoing rejects closed/dormant/blocked/expired. Incoming rejects closed/expired.
Sources: Account.validateAvailableForDebit() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/account/domain/Account.java:204; Account.validateAvailableForCredit() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/account/domain/Account.java:212</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask13" name="06 | Debit A: 1000 → 900 EUR&#10;AccountBalance.debit(100)&#10;UPDATE account_balances">
        <bpmn:documentation>Require available &gt;= 100. current_balance -=100; reserved unchanged; updated_at auditing. Available=current-reserved.
Sources: AccountBalance.debit() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/account/domain/AccountBalance.java:89</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask14" name="07 | Credit B: 500 → 600 EUR&#10;AccountBalance.credit(100)&#10;UPDATE account_balances">
        <bpmn:documentation>current_balance +=100; reserved unchanged; updated_at auditing.
Sources: AccountBalance.credit() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/account/domain/AccountBalance.java:101</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask15" name="08 | Complete + record Outbox&#10;Transfer.complete()&#10;publishCompleted() [MANDATORY]">
        <bpmn:documentation>UPDATE fluxbank.transfers status=COMPLETED, completed_at=now, failure_reason=null; INSERT fluxbank.outbox_event PENDING with immutable snapshot. OutboxEventRepository.save() joins the financial TX.
Sources: Transfer.complete() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/domain/Transfer.java:207; OutboxTransferEventPublisher.publishCompleted() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/infrastructure/OutboxTransferEventPublisher.java:32; OutboxEvent.create() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/outbox/domain/OutboxEvent.java:61</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_endEvent16" name="COMMIT all financial writes">
        <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow17" sourceRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask10" targetRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask11" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow18" sourceRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask11" targetRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask12" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow19" sourceRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask12" targetRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask13" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow20" sourceRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask13" targetRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask14" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow21" sourceRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask14" targetRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask15" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow22" sourceRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask15" targetRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_endEvent16" />
    </bpmn:subProcess>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow23" sourceRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_subProcess2" targetRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_subProcess9" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask24" name="09 | Return COMPLETED&#10;TransferLifecycleService.getResponse()&#10;HTTP 201; History not awaited">
      <bpmn:documentation>Separate readOnly transaction. Financial commit is complete; Outbox poller discovers committed event. Continue at fluxbank-kafka-outbox-history-detail.bpmn.
Sources: TransferLifecycleService.getResponse() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/TransferLifecycleService.java:79</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow25" sourceRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_subProcess9" targetRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask24" />
    <bpmn:boundaryEvent id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_boundaryEvent26" name="Rollback" attachedToRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_subProcess9" cancelActivity="true">
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow28</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:errorEventDefinition id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_boundaryEvent26_error" />
    </bpmn:boundaryEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask27" name="Financial ROLLBACK&#10;Balances + completion + Outbox undone&#10;Earlier PENDING commit survives">
      <bpmn:documentation>Runtime or commit failure rolls back TX-FINANCIAL only. TX-PENDING failure rolls back its INSERT; no financial processing starts.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow28</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow30</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow28" sourceRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_boundaryEvent26" targetRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask27" />
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_exclusiveGateway29" name="Known business exception?">
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow30</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow33</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow34</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow30" sourceRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask27" targetRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_exclusiveGateway29" />
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask31" name="Separate TX: mark FAILED&#10;TransferLifecycleService.markFailed()&#10;Rethrow business exception">
      <bpmn:documentation>TransferService catches InsufficientFundsException, debit/credit availability and CurrencyMismatchException. Maps to INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS, SOURCE_ACCOUNT_UNAVAILABLE, DESTINATION_ACCOUNT_UNAVAILABLE, CURRENCY_MISMATCH. Uses findByPublicId(), no explicit row lock.
Sources: TransferLifecycleService.markFailed() — src/main/java/com/fluxbank/transfer/application/TransferLifecycleService.java:65</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow33</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask32" name="Technical failure: keep PENDING&#10;Exception propagates&#10;No pending-transfer recovery job">
      <bpmn:documentation>Unexpected exceptions are not mapped to markFailed(). Failure of markFailed() has no automatic compensation.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow34</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow33" sourceRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_exclusiveGateway29" targetRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask31" name="Yes: 4 mapped types" />
    <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_Flow34" sourceRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_exclusiveGateway29" targetRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_serviceTask32" name="No: technical error" />
  </bpmn:process>
  <bpmn:collaboration id="Collaboration_fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail">
    <bpmn:documentation>03 | INTERNAL: A → B, 100 EUR
Source: current working tree, 2026-11-08. Documentation only; isExecutable=false. Solid arrows = local execution order. Dashed arrows = HTTP/Kafka messages across pools. Green expanded subprocess = Spring database transaction, not BPMN compensation semantics. Red = failure; amber = retry/recovery. DB visibility is by commit and SELECT, not an in-memory message. Open README.md for the source index and linked pages.</bpmn:documentation>
    <bpmn:participant id="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_app_pool" name="FluxBank | internal transfer" processRef="fluxbank-internal-transfer-detail_app" />
  </bpmn:collaboration>
